      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good breakdown of the social democratic logic. now can you do the same for the libertarian side? i need the same level of depth. what are the core philosophical justifications for the absolute right to property and why do they believe individual autonomy should override these \"communitarian\" or \"reparative\" claims? i want to make sure i'm not just giving them a \"strawman\" version in my paper.",
